    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6402e942f26a464ba36f378970b8fa75",
      "statement": "Block translators handle backward compatibility with LangChain v0 blocks that use source_type-based format (e.g., {'type': 'image', 'source_type': 'url', 'url': '...'}). These are recognized and parsed by _convert_v0_multimodal_input_to_v1() as part of the content_blocks normalization pipeline.",
