    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7c05b7fc6059477398a20b0f76e73fd7",
      "statement": "ReasoningContentBlock represents chain-of-thought reasoning from advanced models. The _extract_reasoning_from_additional_kwargs function extracts reasoning from additional_kwargs['reasoning_content'] (used by Ollama, DeepSeek, XAI, Groq) and wraps it as a reasoning block, which is inserted at the start of the content_blocks list.",
